Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(ui): part corners and circle centres in the WCS
 marker pick

With Pick markers armed on the WCS page, a click on a part corner or a
round-edge centre anchors the origin (SetWcs / SetWcsCircle).

Fixes #1502

